@startuml 全局架构层次
title ImprivataProxy — 三层架构总览

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

package "Facades（协议适配层）" as Facades #LightBlue {
  [ImprivataFacade]
  [AdminFacade]
}

package "IdpCore（认证核心层）" as IdpCore #LightGreen {
  [PwdAuthenticator]
  [UidAuthenticator]
  [BadgeUidAuthenticator]
  [PinAuthenticator]
  [JwtTicketIssuer]
  [AuthSessionStore]
  [LockoutPolicy]
  [AuditLogSink]
}

package "Sources（数据源层）" as Sources #LightYellow {
  [LdapClient]
  [AdSyncRunner / AdSyncService]
  [UserStore]
  [EfRepos (Audit/Session/Lockout/Blacklist)]
}

package "Shared（跨层契约）" as Shared #LightGray {
  [IAuditSink]
  [IClientContextProvider]
  [UserIdentity / PwdOrPin]
}

Facades --> IdpCore : 调用认证/令牌/会话
IdpCore --> Sources : 依赖数据接口\n(IUserStore / IRemotePasswordVerifier\n/ ILockoutRepo / IAuthSessionRepo)
Facades --> Sources : Admin 控制器直接\n调用 IUserStore / AdSyncService
Facades --> Shared : HttpClientContextProvider
IdpCore --> Shared : IAuditSink / UserIdentity
Sources --> Shared : PwdOrPin / LockoutState

@enduml
